<page type="text" lines="ocr">
  <layout>One column of verse, running head above it, page number at top right.</layout>
  <page_number>91</page_number>
  <running_head>VARIA POEMATA.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">
      <i>Hunc Lauri voluit tollere pluribus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="2">
      <i>Ornatum foliis caput.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3">
      <i>Fratris dicta fui Castalides simul</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4">
      <i>Fausti excipiunt plausibus, &amp; nouis</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5" para="true">
      <i>Augent muneribus Delphica munera:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6">
      <i>Nec quicquam puero negant.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7">
      <i>Sed Pallas solito sponte benignior</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8">
      <i>Illum praecipuis ornat honoribus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9" para="true">
      <i>Largis nectarei viuida quum labra</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10">
      <i>Succis eloquij rigat:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11">
      <i>Occultaque comes quum sapientia</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12">
      <i>Ignotum per iter duxit in arduos</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13" para="true">
      <i>Colles, ingenuum pectus ut optimis</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14">
      <i>Illic tingeret artibus.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15">
      <i>Quas semper placida iuncta Lubentia</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16">
      <i>Illustrat varias mellifluo sinu</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17" para="true">
      <i>Fundens delicias Gratia: quam decus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18">
      <i>Et circumuolitat fauor.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19">
      <i>His Beta[?] Auspicibus protinus vnidam</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20">
      <i>Latus spernit humum, nec trepidantibus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21" para="true">
      <i>Pennis, purpureum versus in alitem,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22">
      <i>Immensum secat aethera.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23">
      <i>Quem vatum Aeoliis fidibus iuuat</i>
    </l>
    <l n="24">
      <i>Decertare choros inter amabiles,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25" para="true">
      <i>Victorem Aonias Delius annuit</i>
    </l>
    <l n="26">
      <i>Clarum carpere Laureas.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="27">
      <i>Illi Teutonici limitis incola</i>
    </l>
    <l n="28">
      <i>Cedunt, Erydani potor &amp; Italus</i>
    </l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>No marginal notes, headings or catchword. "Beta" and the symbols before "Aeoliis" and "Aonias" are unclear; the symbols are not transcribed. Long s written as s; u/v and i/j normalised.</notes>
